  "published": "2026-11-17T11:59:22.553Z",
  "releaseNotes": "• Added net11.0 targets to the library packages, alongside net10.0\n• Fixed NuGetPackageResolver failing on the assets file of a project that targets more than one framework\n• Removed the Octopus.Nuke.Components package. Its build components now live in this repository's own build\n• Added Microsoft.Testing.Platform options to DotNetTestSettings, including TRX reports, coverage, crash and hang dumps, and ignored exit codes\n• Added TestingPlatformExitCodes, the exit codes of a Microsoft.Testing.Platform test run\n• Fixed host detection failing when a loaded assembly contains types that can't be loaded\n• Removed the net8.0 and net9.0 targets. NUKE now targets net10.0, plus netstandard2.0 or net472 where it did before\n• Changed nuke :setup and nuke :update to set the build project's target framework to net10.0\n• Changed IHazGitVersion to run GitVersion's net10.0 build, which needs GitVersion.Tool 6.6.0 or later\n\nFull changelog at https://github.com/OctopusDeploy/nuke/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
